'' RFC 0018 V4 (symbols/checkmove.tiko, latechecks.tiko, semwalk.tiko, latesweeps2.tiko): a type
'' whose copy constructor and 'let' are private still refuses every COPY -- 'return g' of a
'' shared and 'return o' of a byref parameter (fbc's 205, which tiko did not ask at all and
'' left to fail at the link), 'dim b = a', 'b = a' (TKO0746) and 'Take( a )' -- while the three
'' MOVES at the end, 'move( a )' into a dim, an assignment and an argument, are accepted.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/move-noncopyable.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
