'' EXPECT-OUT: move-noncopyable.tiko(29,1): error TKO0746: the operator let of 'owner' is private or protected and cannot be reached from here
'' EXPECT-OUT: move-noncopyable.tiko(30,7): error TKO0633: 'owner' needs a constructor or destructor that is not accessible here
'' EXPECT-OUT: move-noncopyable.tiko(28,14): error TKO0633: 'b' needs a constructor or destructor that is not accessible here
